---
// A factor in one picture: sort stocks by one characteristic, buy the top group, short the bottom group.
// Ten stocks with made-up book-to-market ratios and next-month returns (the caption says so).
// Python check: long top 3 = (3.1+1.9+2.4)/3 = 2.47; short bottom 3 = (-1.2+0.2-2.3)/3 = -1.10; spread = 3.57.
const rows = [
  { s: 'AAA', b: 1.8, r: 3.1 }, { s: 'BBB', b: 1.45, r: 1.9 }, { s: 'CCC', b: 1.2, r: 2.4 },
  { s: 'DDD', b: 0.95, r: 0.6 }, { s: 'EEE', b: 0.8, r: 1.1 }, { s: 'FFF', b: 0.7, r: -0.4 },
  { s: 'GGG', b: 0.55, r: 0.8 }, { s: 'HHH', b: 0.42, r: -1.2 }, { s: 'III', b: 0.3, r: 0.2 }, { s: 'JJJ', b: 0.2, r: -2.3 },
];
const W = 900, H = 430, X0 = 120, BW = 260;
const rowY = (i: number) => 74 + i * 28;
const rx = (r: number) => 640 + r * 30;
---
<figure class="p06a">
  <div class="p06a-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Ten stocks sorted from high to low book-to-market. The top three are marked long and the bottom three short. Next-month returns: the long group averages +2.47 percent, the short group averages -1.10 percent, so the factor return is +3.57 percent.">
      <text x="20" y="26" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>A factor is a sort, then a spread</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Factor là một phép xếp hạng, rồi lấy chênh lệch</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="48" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Sorted by book-to-market (high = "cheap"), then the return of the month that follows</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Xếp theo book-to-market (cao = "rẻ"), rồi lợi nhuận của tháng kế tiếp</tspan></text>
      <text x={X0} y="68" class="m" text-anchor="start"><tspan data-lang-en>book-to-market</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>book-to-market</tspan></text>
      <text x="640" y="68" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>next-month return (%)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lợi nhuận tháng sau (%)</tspan></text>
      <rect x="14" y={rowY(0) - 3} width="480" height="86" rx="6" class="band-long" />
      <rect x="14" y={rowY(7) - 3} width="480" height="86" rx="6" class="band-short" />
      <line x1="640" y1="76" x2="640" y2="354" class="axis" />
      {rows.map((r, i) => (
        <g>
          <text x="26" y={rowY(i) + 16} class="sym">{r.s}</text>
          <rect x={X0} y={rowY(i) + 3} width={r.b / 1.8 * BW} height="16" rx="3" class={i < 3 ? 'bar long' : i > 6 ? 'bar short' : 'bar'} />
          <text x={X0 + r.b / 1.8 * BW + 8} y={rowY(i) + 16} class="n">{r.b.toFixed(2)}</text>
          <rect x={r.r >= 0 ? 640 : rx(r.r)} y={rowY(i) + 3} width={Math.abs(r.r) * 30} height="16" rx="3" class="ret" />
          <text x={r.r >= 0 ? rx(r.r) + 6 : rx(r.r) - 6} y={rowY(i) + 16} class="n" text-anchor={r.r >= 0 ? 'start' : 'end'}>{(r.r > 0 ? '+' : '') + r.r.toFixed(1)}</text>
        </g>
      ))}
      <text x="26" y="372" class="lg is-gold"><tspan data-lang-en>Long the top 3: average +2.47%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mua 3 mã đầu: trung bình +2,47%</tspan></text>
      <text x="26" y="394" class="lg is-red"><tspan data-lang-en>Short the bottom 3: average −1.10%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bán khống 3 mã cuối: trung bình −1,10%</tspan></text>
      <text x="520" y="372" class="lg"><tspan data-lang-en>Factor return = 2.47 − (−1.10) = +3.57%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lợi nhuận factor = 2,47 − (−1,10) = +3,57%</tspan></text>
      <text x="520" y="394" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>One month. A factor series is this number, month after month.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một tháng. Chuỗi factor là con số này, tháng nối tháng.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Say ten stocks have the book-to-market ratios and next-month returns shown (made-up numbers for the walk-through). The factor return is what the top group earned minus what the bottom group earned.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Giả sử mười cổ phiếu có book-to-market và lợi nhuận tháng sau như trong hình (số tự đặt cho phần giải thích). Lợi nhuận factor là phần nhóm đầu kiếm được trừ đi phần nhóm cuối kiếm được.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .p06a { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p06a-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p06a svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .p06a text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p06a .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p06a .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .p06a .sym { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p06a .n { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text); }
  .p06a .lg { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p06a .lg.is-gold { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .p06a .lg.is-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .p06a .band-long { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); }
  .p06a .band-short { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .p06a .axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .p06a .bar { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.1; }
  .p06a .bar.long { fill: var(--gold); stroke: var(--gold-icon); }
  .p06a .bar.short { fill: var(--red); stroke: var(--red); opacity: 0.75; }
  .p06a .ret { fill: var(--text-faint); opacity: 0.6; }
  .p06a figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
